    "long_instructions": "#### Find the cause by undoing changes\r\n\r\n1. Make two small changes to your project, like editing a heading and a color.\r\n2. Make a third change that breaks something. For example, type “consol.log” instead of “console.log.”\r\n3. Check your preview. You should see a problem.\r\n4. Undo your changes one at a time, newest first. Check your page after each one.\r\n5. Stop when the problem is gone. Name the change that caused it.\r\n\r\nExample: “The problem went away when I undid the typo. Undoing one change at a time showed me the typo was the cause.”",
